  "question": {
    "text": "<math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math> satisfies the condition <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&nbsp;≥</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>3</mn></math>. Then the least value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "From triangle inequality we know that <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>≥</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br />hence <math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mo>≥</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>≥</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br />Hence <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> is the correct answer."
  }
